    turnFlow: '1. **Direction**: Play proceeds counter-clockwise. 2. **Turn**: Each turn consists of drawing one card (from Stock or Ground) and discarding one card. 3. **Melding**: A player may place valid melds face up on the table once they meet the minimum requirements (often a single 50-point meld or a specific sequence length).',
